    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Abstract: We introduce the notion of p-adic spherical codes (in particular, p-adic kissing number problem). We show that the one-line proof for a variant of the Delsarte-Goethals-Seidel-KabatianskiiLevenshtein upper bound for spherical codes, obtained by Pfender [J. Combin. Theory Ser. A, 2007], extends to p-adic Hilbert spaces."
  }, {
