    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Keywords: Spherical code, Kissing number, Linear programming, p-adic Hilbert space. Mathematics Subject Classiﬁcation (2020): 52C17, 12J25, 46S10, 11D88."
